  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A.L.T. CAPORALATO D.U.E.: Actions for Legality and Labour Protection - Dignity, Equality and Equity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on two complementary initiatives that are ongoing since 2020 (A.L.T. Caporalato! and Su.Pr.Eme), the general objective of the project is to reduce migrants&#x2019; exposure to labour exploitation by enhancing the efficiency of labour inspections; strengthening the national referral mechanisms for victims of labour exploitation and also facilitating  victims&#x2019; reintegration in the national labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
